OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with some clear intervals
OL,8,Fbetween showers, some of which will be
OL,9,Fheavy. Breezy in the evening then
OL,10,Fwinds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,13,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,15,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,16,Fto largely dry conditions in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
