OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Saturday.
OL,7,FMostly dry and bright with light winds
OL,8,FSunday and Monday, cloudier for Outer
OL,9,FHebrides. Strong winds for Outer
OL,10,FHebrides Sunday and Monday.
